Code review: Project Euler problem 1 in Python - Multiples of 3 and 5
Critique: The algorithm can be optimized by getting rid of the for loops and using sum on generator expressions or sets.

REVISED: 
<pre><code>def solution_01(n):
    partialsum = sum(xrange(3, n, 3))  
    return partialsum + sum(x for x in xrange(5, n, 5) if x % 3)

def solution_01(n):
    values = set(range(3, n, 3)) | set(range(5, n, 5))
    return sum(values)
</code></pre>

